{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112406","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112406/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112406/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112406/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112406","id":3589279574,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7V8A9W","number":112406,"title":"NavigationRegion3D creates terrible navmeshes on large terrain","user":{"login":"angall1","id":80722625,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwNzIyNjI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80722625?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/angall1","html_url":"https://github.com/angall1","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angall1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angall1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angall1/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angall1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angall1/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angall1/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angall1/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angall1/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angall1/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1752040694,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzUyMDQwNjk0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:navigation","name":"topic:navigation","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-11-05T04:48:18Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T17:19:33Z","closed_at":"2025-11-05T16:53:33Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":"resolved","sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in latest stable version of Godot on Steam\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.1.stable (f62fdbde1) - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 SUPER (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8108) - AMD Ryzen 5 2600 Six-Core Processor (12 threads) - 15.93 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nIf you create a MeshInstance3D with a large (100m+) and noisy terrain and bake meshes for them using the \"Create Navigation Mesh\", it comes out with a great looking and accurate navmesh. \n\n<img width=\"1404\" height=\"560\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7985dbfe-8ec3-440c-98a6-ecd682353f57\" />\n\nHowever, if you try to create the same exact navmesh using NavigationRegion3D, it creates this monstrosity. \n\n<img width=\"1892\" height=\"660\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1784c18d-8153-4178-a8d5-2cb7db52e5b1\" />\n\nBoth of these navmesh generations are on the default settings of the nodes, altering cell size in the NavigationRegion3D does not improve the mesh at all. \n\nHere is an example of why this is a problem. This is a 2m tall player that can move entirely under the generated Navmesh. If an agent tried to pathfind to this player, they would find no valid path as the player is 3 meters underground according to the Navmesh.\n\n<img width=\"1119\" height=\"537\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eb683d31-b15e-4af0-af3e-909b9d256489\" />\n\nWhen testing the first navmesh with a simple agent that tracks the players movement, the agent typically gets stuck or will take strange routes.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a MeshInstance3D with large, noisy terrain\nAdd a NavigationRegion3D as a parent\nBake the navmesh\nObserve terrible mesh\nSelect MeshInstance3D, Create Navmesh (top middle of editor)\nObserve beautiful mesh\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[navmesh test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23350713/navmesh.test.zip)\n\n","closed_by":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112406/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112406/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}